                "text": "The PACT Act includes a provision in honor of the late Hawai\u02bbi Congressman Mark Takai. The Mark Takai Atomic Veterans Healthcare Parity Act permits veterans who participated in the cleanup of Enewetak Atoll to receive service-connected compensation benefits & medical care. (2/2)",
