                "text": "Full Health Care for the National Guard\n\nTotal Annual Cost: $719M\nTotal National Guard Members: 400K\n\nTotal Annual Cost: $1787.50\nTotal Monthly Cost: $148.95\n\nIt is unacceptable that 15% of our National Guard service members do not have healthcare. \n \nCongress must do better.",
